MakeFR v1.5 ---- utility for creating a banner with the latest download from
				 Aminet. Since this work can be boring I made this little 
				 command for my Sysop (and for all sysop who'll use this).
				 Try: MakeFR HELP
				 The argument of keyword HEAD and TAIL are in the 
				 ENV:MakeFRHead and Env:MakeFRTail 
				 
				 For example if you have a directory called Aminet: ,that has 
				 all the new files from Aminet you taken ( with .readme )... 
				 you can do:
				 1> MakeFR From Aminet: To ram:newfiles.txt HEAD ASCII:banner
				 ...and you'll find the file ram:newfiles.txt that you
				 can post on FidoNet as the new files from Aminet.
				 
				 This is FREEWARE, but I'll be happy if you send me a mail.
